The '''Ongidae''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that lived in [[the galaxy]].<ref name="Commander" /> [[Pemmin Brunce]] was an Ongidae who worked as the head of security in the [[Canto Bight]] [[Canto Casino and Racetrack|casino]] on [[Cantonica]].<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|pemmin-brunce|Pemmin Brunce}}</ref>

{{Species-stub}}

==Society and culture==
Ongidae were strong and disciplined, which made them ideal [[Infantry|foot-soldiers]].<ref name="Commander" />

==Ongidae in the galaxy==
Although the [[Galactic Empire]] rarely enlisted [[Alien|non-humans]], they did make use of [[Ongidae Oppressor]]s.<ref name="Commander" />

